  "synopsis": "A Taoist priest is tracking a demon when he discovers a human girl being raised by it. Having eaten demons since childhood, the girl’s body has changed so much that ordinary food from the human world cannot sustain her. Meanwhile, the demon can no longer care for her because of an impending heavenly tribulation.\n\nThe priest takes the girl as his disciple and gives her the Taoist name Shangshan. Thus begins the journey of master and student.\n\n(Source: Bilibili)",
